# Check out text files with LF everywhere, Windows included (wicked-estate#360). Tests read
# sources with include_str!, fixtures are hashed byte-for-byte, and the index stores digests of
# file bytes: a CRLF working tree would change every one of them on Windows only.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary documents (doc_convert fixtures): byte-exact, never normalized or diffed as text.
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.ppt binary
*.pptx binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.rtf binary
*.epub binary
*.odt binary
*.odp binary
*.ods binary
